      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There are some problems with `legacyFolders` and `legacyFiles`.\n\n[BUG] legacyFolders and legacyFiles only removed if ALL folders and files listed are found in the project. · Issue #281 · vrchat-community/creator-companion\n\nhttps://github.com/vrchat-community/creator-companion/issues/281\n\nThe other problem occurs in community repositories, where legacyFolders/Files for packages installed by `vpmDependencies` are ignored.\n\nAlso, package.json is ignored when installed via repositories.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
