  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-10-05T19:44:57.126Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "VPM manifest provides options for \"legacyFolders\" and \"legacyFiles\" which will be removed when VCC adds the package. \nhttps://vpm-package-maker.glitch.me/vpm/packages#vpm-manifest-additions\nThese options do not appear to work for user packages. Adding the path with and without the GUID do not remove the original files and folders.",
